# F1 in the OTHER direction, and the reviewer's open question 1 as a ruling.
# One valid committed claim, one valid replacement, and one unrelated unreadable
# sibling JSONL in the same directory. Unknown completeness must suppress
# authority WITHOUT renaming the claim; under the injection the sibling's
